WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.127
I need to defeat them on the spot.

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:12.012
I need to survive no matter what!

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:18.393
Well, I'm not sure
if this is accurate, but…

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.187
It's a…

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:25.025
It's a phone!

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.195
Hey, hold on there!

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.197
Let me borrow it!

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.783
Let me borrow your phone!

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.201
What? Sure.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.291
Is that you, Yuri?

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.293
Rika.

00:00:45.962 --> 00:00:50.675
It's Rika!

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:58.016
That's right. I haven't eaten anything.

00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:01.811
Do they even have food here?

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:04.105
What's that?

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.987
It's packed with lots of stuff.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:12.989
Could these be provisions?

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:15.700
I even found this.

00:01:18.661 --> 00:01:20.246
A white cardboard box.

00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:22.749
It's somewhere on the rooftop.

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:26.920
You'll find a Mouthless Mask in there.

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:32.342
It might be pointless to put
the mask on right now in this situation.

00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:37.097
Even so, I…

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:41.434
I want to save Mayuko!

00:01:43.394 --> 00:01:44.229
There it is!

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:45.563
I see the code!

00:01:47.565 --> 00:01:49.234
Please, Mouthless Mask!

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:51.653
Give me power!

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:56.658
Give me the power
to survive in this world!

00:01:57.242 --> 00:02:01.079
The power to protect Mayuko and everyone!

00:02:16.845 --> 00:02:17.762
KEEP ONE'S SELF NEAT

00:02:21.391 --> 00:02:23.309
Is it due to the crack in my mask?

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:26.688
I've regained a modicum of control
over my own thoughts,

00:02:27.397 --> 00:02:29.941
yet not enough to defy the Commands.

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:57.802
Goodness.

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:03.433
Does a cracked mask mean that
I'll be attacked by other Masks?

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:05.518
This could be troubling.

00:03:05.894 --> 00:03:07.312
I get to reunite with Rika!

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:08.479
And one more thing.

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:11.149
I've got a little favor to ask.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:12.817
That Mayuko girl…

00:03:13.318 --> 00:03:14.986
Mayuko Nise, right?

00:03:15.486 --> 00:03:17.322
The one who became your ally.

00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:20.700
Shoot her to death, right now.

00:03:20.825 --> 00:03:21.743
Sure, okay…

00:03:23.328 --> 00:03:24.245
What?

00:03:24.621 --> 00:03:28.583
Yuri, you can't let your guard down
thinking you've got an ally now.

00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:33.129
In this world,
you need to kill before you get killed.

00:03:34.339 --> 00:03:36.591
What you need to do right now

00:03:36.633 --> 00:03:40.094
is to kill Mayuko Nise
and wait until I rescue you.

00:03:41.763 --> 00:03:47.435
Yuri, all I want is for you to be okay.

00:03:54.275 --> 00:03:55.109
It's chilly.

00:03:56.110 --> 00:04:01.157
Hey, Rika, if you're going to
continue talking like this,

00:04:02.158 --> 00:04:03.701
I'll kill you instead.

00:04:06.663 --> 00:04:11.125
Are you saying
you're prioritizing her over my rescue?

00:04:11.209 --> 00:04:12.126
That's right.

00:04:13.461 --> 00:04:14.295
All right.

00:04:15.129 --> 00:04:18.132
We'll hold off on me coming to rescue you.

00:04:18.174 --> 00:04:22.011
Let me get in on
your helicopter usurpation plan too.

00:04:23.054 --> 00:04:25.515
Oh, now I get it.

00:04:25.598 --> 00:04:26.849
According to my intel,

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:30.853
the helicopter arrives at a depot
somewhere every day.

00:04:31.312 --> 00:04:33.898
So instead of meeting up,

00:04:33.982 --> 00:04:37.026
we should wait in different places
to seize our chance.

00:04:37.151 --> 00:04:41.990
He said that horrible idea
to test my determination.

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:45.535
We'll gather allies and weapons
for tomorrow's helicopter and--

00:04:45.618 --> 00:04:47.078
You know what, Rika?

00:04:47.203 --> 00:04:48.288
What?

00:04:48.371 --> 00:04:51.791
You really have a twisted personality.

